# Web3Forms access key for the contact form (the form falls back to a
# prefilled email draft until this is set). Free, unlimited — get a key by
# entering your email at https://web3forms.com (no account needed).
# NOTE: NEXT_PUBLIC_* vars are baked in at build time — set this in Vercel
# BEFORE the production build, then redeploy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
